    },
    "Source code: github.com/JesseTG/melonds-ds, tag v1.4.0. Arcfold builds it without JIT. On 7 November 2026 Arcfold changed it so that it builds without libpcap, took out DownloadTmd and CacheTmd, which download and store title metadata in the DSi mode, and removed the DSi's key material from melonDS, which is part of it. The changes are in Scripts/cores/melondsds.sh in Arcfold's source code." : {
      "comment" : "Where the source of the melonDS DS core is and how Arcfold changed it, on the Licenses screen. Keep the address, the tag, the date, the function names and the file path."
